  },
  {
    question: "Can you redesign an existing website?",
    answer:
      "Yes. We can redesign existing websites to improve their visual quality, mobile experience, performance, content structure, SEO foundation and conversion journey.",
  },
  {
    question: "Do you build websites for small businesses?",
    answer:
      "Yes. We work with local businesses, startups, professional service providers, restaurants, cafés, hotels, real estate businesses, creators, agencies and growing brands.",
